  (text "Notes:\nCyclonic Separator Fans: (CRA0412PAK03)\nInput Voltage: 12V\n\nN channel mosfets dictate when the Fans get power.\n	fan#_1/0 mosfet pwm pin\nControl the speed by adjusting the PWM duty cycle 0-100%\n	fanSpeed# is a pwm for the fan's speed controller. \n\n"
    (at 138.43 158.75 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
